+/**
+ * SPI class (McKee, Doesken & Kleist 1993). Wet classes include their lower
+ * bound (1.0–1.49 moderately wet) and dry classes their upper bound (−1.0 to
+ * −1.49 moderately dry), so SPI = −1.0 is moderately dry as the "≤ −1" counts assume.
